OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife                
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry        
OL,6,Fevening and night with some long clear 
OL,7,Fperiods. Frost will develop and will   
OL,8,Fbecome moderate to severe in sheltered 
OL,9,Fspots in the west, perhaps some fog    
OL,10,Fpatches.                               
OL,12,CMonday:FAnother dry and bright day     
OL,13,Fwith some long sunny spells. Rather    
OL,14,Fcold with frost early and late.        
OL,16,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FRain  
OL,17,Fspreading east on Tuesday with snow on 
OL,18,Fhigher ground for a time. Rain         
OL,19,Flingering into Wednesday in east,      
OL,20,Fdying out later then mainly dry on     
OL,21,FThursday.                              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
